All,

Since lightsabers were already in Slashem, I thought to code the Jedi
character with astromech for pet.    Main restriction is that a Jedi
CANNOT read magic, though the character can use wands or passive magic
as a sufficiently high form of technology. Main plus would be selective
reflection when wielding a lightsaber built by the character (and ONLY
a Jedi can build one).  There would also be a selection of Force stunts
through the techniques menu, and a series of psi-related magic as the
character goes up in level.

1) Would these tradeoffs make for a acceptable game balance?
2) Would Lucasfilms seek to ban this variety of Slashem?  I'm thinking
the game is protected as free speech (satire) as part of the charm of
the game is that it incorporates elements of popular culture.

Comments?

